{
  "bodyHash": "2d44f600930fae45",
  "content": "<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">必需依赖项：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">Epic Fight by maninthe_home</span></strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Weapons of Miracles by reascer</strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/to-tweaks-irons-spells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>T.O Magic 'n Extras by GameTechBC</strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-invincible\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Epic Fight - Invincible by P1nero</strong></em></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>Epic Fight: Resurrection by Corrupt_Dog</strong></em></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">强烈推荐：</span></strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-x-t-o-magic-n-extras-armors-patch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em><strong>EF x T.O Magic 'n Extras - Armors Patch (资源包) by me</strong></em></a> (主要修复护甲胸甲部分不可见的问题)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>2025年9月14日：立即加入我们的 Discord 服务器：</strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>视频：(版本 1.3.0)<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0hKi1NRPJuo?si=BJL1xilSEI41khPe\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>视频：(版本 1.1.0.a)</strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XbbOTGxEvuA?si=z_ul-NvWEG-_E_v3\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>视频：(已过时：版本 1.0.4)</strong></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wVCaeAwQMaI?si=pWIw1pB457fgb94H\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">简介：</span></strong></p>\n<p>这不是梦，这是 <strong>Epic Fight x T.O Magic 'n Extras'</strong>。拥有大量动作集来粉碎并摧毁你的敌人！</p>\n<p>使用这些动作集进行有趣的冒险和游戏，让你的模组包更加精彩……</p>\n<p><strong>而且……</strong> 这些动作集的特殊之处在于，其中有8个动作集可以与 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">法术攻击进行连招</span></strong>，这些连招是由 EF - Invincible (你可以观看我的视频了解如何执行) 制作的。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">以下是所有连招的执行方法：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">在我们开始之前，我需要大家注意这一点：这是我使用的所有连招按键（你可以在选项/控制.../按键绑定...中更改它们并向下滚动）（左键和右键实际上是指鼠标左键单击和鼠标右键单击）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_9b5c411d-ccb1-48db-aa80-8eee51754571.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"794\" height=\"202\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">更新：版本 1.1.0 (即版本 1.1.0.a)</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>品牌全新固有技能：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><em>*注意：* = 乘算</em></strong></p>\n<p>*重做</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">永恒雷暴·阿夸</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#3598db\">- 自触电击充能者</span> <strong>(KEY3 + KEY1)</strong>：在自身位置召唤闪电，随后向前冲刺突破（造成1.5倍伤害），利用水生之力击倒敌人（消耗1层充能 / 冷却时间：10秒）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_a33166af-0c02-4a5e-876a-1934d7bb3936.png\" width=\"193\" height=\"180\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e2865a47-b3c4-4579-9ae0-c278b051c316.png\" width=\"182\" height=\"182\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_3b0f87dc-51b5-4243-979b-a066dc909d73.png\" width=\"262\" height=\"182\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 潮汐斩击 (KEY1_2, 同时按下鼠标左键和右键)：水刃斩击造成更高伤害，被命中的生物将受到“潮湿”效果（无法窃取法力值）（消耗2层充能 / 冷却时间：16秒）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e04811f0-696d-4cc8-8b11-328c67db1c99.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"210\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_f4b36b60-b465-4894-a0f8-323e1e27554c.png\" width=\"314\" height=\"211\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_c5ab4924-3ba3-4d88-bc6c-66593f7daae2.png\" width=\"235\" height=\"211\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>潮汐斩击伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp; * (属性) 水系法术强度，攻击伤害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 荣耀雷暴 (KEY4)：愤怒闪电的强化版，在附近敌人处召唤强力闪电打击，并向前制造海啸，持续15秒（消耗3层充能 / 冷却时间：35秒）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_15054bc8-f605-4288-a50e-683f3c86d1d4.png\" width=\"214\" height=\"223\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_999ce74b-fecc-4913-8506-8c62509338d1.png\" width=\"386\" height=\"220\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_bfd342bd-8ced-40e9-a7c5-6bd121cf62a8.png\" width=\"288\" height=\"220\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>波浪实体伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp; * (属性) 水系法术强度，攻击伤害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">*新增：</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">沙暴觉醒：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 践踏连击 (Combo)：完成所有普通攻击 (KEY1) 后，按 KEY3 执行冲刺践踏攻击，然后按 KEY1 执行两次连击践踏攻击（冷却时间：10秒 / 消耗1层充能）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_f267c70e-878c-4e86-bf14-c8013f5ba814.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"228\"><strong style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_07b380ba-fa1e-449b-8afa-389739fe565f.png\" width=\"259\" height=\"224\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_03548913-7c53-4584-a058-8469e89ea293.png\" width=\"212\" height=\"225\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>践踏范围伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;* (属性) 自然法术强度，攻击伤害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 沙漠风刃斩 (KEY1_2 / 同时按下鼠标左键和右键)：旋转攻击向前发射小型沙暴（冷却时间：15秒 / 消耗：1层充能）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_58cd7fc8-60f0-473f-a702-40682ccd2846.png\" width=\"260\" height=\"213\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_ddc96c08-c7b4-4c41-b4dc-85ca9e85b1b7.png\" width=\"221\" height=\"212\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_954f5feb-8bb8-4cea-a703-d140ff86fb80.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"212\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">沙暴投射物伤害可通过以下属性增加：</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> * (属性) 神圣/自然法术强度，灾变配置：沙暴伤害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 沙暴环绕 (KEY3)：咆哮震慑附近敌人使其眩晕，并在你周围创建3个旋转的沙暴，持续15秒（冷却时间：35秒 / 消耗2层充能）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_623adb30-5c98-4b91-a62c-78c501d0b8ab.png\" width=\"260\" height=\"207\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_4c5e2b70-3e82-4025-a1b6-ce377a6ada19.png\" width=\"198\" height=\"206\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_696166e1-d5f9-4c09-b1c5-7a4f05a511d9.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"205\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">沙暴实体伤害可通过以下属性增加：</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> * (属性) 神圣/自然法术强度，攻击伤害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 石碑坠落 (KEY4)：快速横扫攻击，并在你周围8格范围内以环形召唤多根古代沙漠石碑从天而降，造成巨大伤害（冷却时间：25秒 / 消耗3层充能）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_79b346a2-0c52-412a-ba8b-f4090d710dac.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"230\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_81d3d98d-e15e-4481-a6fb-12f0043b3871.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"231\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_b84af9fd-c6df-4fd1-821a-82fae5bf6ac5.png\" width=\"248\" height=\"229\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">古代石碑伤害可通过以下属性增加：</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> * (属性) 神圣/自然法术强度，攻击伤害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">地狱核心：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 熔岩炸弹 (KEY3)：发射一枚熔岩炸弹，触地时爆炸并留下一小滩熔岩（冷却时间：7.5秒 / 消耗1层充能）</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_abe96d72-ffdf-454a-bca2-14933d11bac7.png\" width=\"224\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_b8fb7f0f-8a9a-4ec1-81a7-dba3c7f40efd.png\" width=\"203\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_39f2b514-1a64-4fb0-86cc-b03762d26891.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"215\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 震地轰鸣 (连招：KEY1_2 / 同时按下鼠标右键和左键 + KEY2 + KEY2)：撞击地面，在你附近创造多个火焰喷射，造成高伤害并施加燃烧效果（无冷却时间 / 消耗1层充能，总消耗：2层充能）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_94d26f65-887c-4114-90aa-c82b1a9b9820.png\" width=\"189\" height=\"194\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_73fc668e-5bf1-4b19-be18-346147e00bdd.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"195\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_0dbfcf10-cf66-4004-b099-04a209f9d0d1.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<p><strong>火焰喷射伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (属性) 火系法术强度，T.O MnE 配置：</span></p>\n<pre>WeaponConfig:infernalDevastatorBlazingSalvoDamageMultiplier</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 地狱陀螺斩 (KEY4)：横扫攻击创造出向前推进的火“环状斩击”，被命中的生物将受到“火焰真空”效果，该效果在3秒后激活并召唤环绕他们的火焰喷射（冷却时间：15秒 / 消耗2层充能）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_5ef177e5-679e-4e6a-89f8-3acce9e2ce1d.png\" width=\"211\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_3aa4252e-5e9f-4c29-a241-31fc957ae2b5.png\" width=\"240\" height=\"181\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_05ee4d8e-0b6e-464c-b0c6-5f727e1677d8.png\" width=\"188\" height=\"182\"></p>\n<p><strong>陀螺斩伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (属性) 火系法术强度，攻击伤害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">地狱火山：</span></strong></p>\n<p>- 三重烈焰 (连招)：完成所有普通攻击连招后，按 KEY2 (3次) 执行3次连招，每次发射一枚烈焰炸弹（无冷却时间 / 消耗1层充能）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_335a4962-e3b5-4746-9acb-537aa7c0ab1a.png\" width=\"243\" height=\"215\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_bd17d29b-ea95-431c-8527-520127606a50.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"215\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_656c594e-0fce-4f4e-b5f2-87e3b2eed1ad.png\" width=\"236\" height=\"214\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>火焰喷射伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (属性) 火系法术强度，T.O MnE 配置：</span></p>\n<pre>WeaponConfig:infernalDevastatorBlazingSalvoDamageMultiplier</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 三重爆炸射击 (KEY3)：发射3枚熔岩炸弹（冷却时间：10秒 / 消耗1层充能）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_d7b53bfb-4a9f-4bd4-b76a-786ec6b11441.png\" width=\"232\" height=\"208\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_953fb68e-81e9-4351-8098-f60194319be9.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"209\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 岩浆喷发 (KEY4)：震地轰鸣的强化版，创造短暂的地震并召唤周围大量的火焰喷射（冷却时间：25秒 / 消耗3层充能）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_06a20a23-acb5-464e-abfc-a9418add8ab3.png\" width=\"211\" height=\"244\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e059c692-397f-49a7-899f-224d32e07347.png\" width=\"256\" height=\"244\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_83ec4f40-e7f7-4f98-8c31-0f06d6af05cb.png\" width=\"274\" height=\"245\"></span></p>\n<p><strong>火焰喷射伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (属性) 火系法术强度，T.O MnE 配置：</span></p>\n<pre>WeaponConfig:infernalDevastatorBlazingSalvoDamageMultiplier</pre>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>地震范围伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;*<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> (属性) 火系法术强度，攻击伤害</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">夜幕降临：</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 旋转镰刀向前 (连招)：完成所有普通攻击后，按 KEY2 执行额外的特殊旋转攻击（无冷却时间 / 无消耗）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_46d1caff-afb2-4fb8-b765-3eae140d9591.png\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_7a18bbdd-82ad-4340-b8b4-56842b41bf43.png\" width=\"195\" height=\"195\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 虚空十字斩 (连招)：执行前4次连招后，按 KEY2 施展强大的虚空斩击向前推进并延长路径上的斩击范围，被命中的生物将被击飞至空中3秒并瞬间重重落地（冷却时间：7.5秒 / 消耗2层充能）</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_71adaf03-2b90-4857-a660-2fca275d15f3.png\" width=\"305\" height=\"185\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_1f45a728-2fd5-41d0-b696-4876ef3393d4.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"186\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_75d1f2c5-9fb2-42bc-b0ea-11d3f7fefbe0.png\" width=\"242\" height=\"261\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_2d8c2439-d526-4446-a12d-7e4d7f8e1384.png\" width=\"308\" height=\"262\"></p>\n<p><strong>虚空斩击伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;* (属性) 末影/诡秘法术强度，攻击伤害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 爆炸克隆之路 (KEY3)：快速向前旋转，创造许多夜卫兵的克隆体，它们在3.5格半径内爆炸，对附近的怪物造成高伤害 [再次按下 KEY3 执行末影步向前]（冷却时间：20秒 / 消耗2层充能）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_ad3c6184-ad93-4c12-995a-3919b536a035.png\" width=\"290\" height=\"210\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_1e6bc346-9496-49c9-81c9-39a394212810.png\" width=\"239\" height=\"209\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_5520e980-5c11-4f3e-9168-07b3c4558ad4.png\" width=\"328\" height=\"284\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_99df6753-97fb-462a-9e34-0941f83e4af3.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"285\"></p>\n<p><strong>夜卫兵爆炸克隆伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;* (属性) 末影/诡秘法术强度，攻击伤害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 重击：双排致命尖刺 (KEY1_2, 同时按下鼠标右键和左键)：放大你的镰刀，猛击地面创造两排维度尖刺（冷却时间：15秒 / 消耗1层充能）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_448cbb08-fe86-4709-ba41-adcbe9c5df8c.png\" width=\"254\" height=\"251\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_e9269952-fca8-4e5d-8ee1-e7a36a0f65a4.png\" width=\"268\" height=\"252\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_14fc4bef-1b4b-4832-9a84-463b1f20afb6.png\" width=\"334\" height=\"264\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_f57c2c3c-0fe8-4496-9647-db19b6808e66.png\" width=\"358\" height=\"264\"></p>\n<p><strong>维度尖刺伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;* (属性) 末影/诡秘法术强度，攻击伤害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- 重击：末影崛起 (KEY4)：放大你的镰刀，猛击地面创造维度尖刺环，并在“镰刀头”撞击点周围产生3次末地喷发（冷却时间：25秒 / 消耗2层充能）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_11c09ace-ff77-42cc-8846-94f374bc3fe6.png\" width=\"246\" height=\"235\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_76e5227f-3d93-44a0-9db7-a56bf5df8e5f.png\" width=\"313\" height=\"234\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_9385c10c-392f-404b-abf4-1090c886d7c5.png\" width=\"344\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_8155353b-96bf-4304-8550-0f0338152fb9.png\" width=\"275\" height=\"216\"></p>\n<p><strong>维度尖刺伤害 &amp; 末地喷发伤害可通过以下属性增加：</strong>&nbsp;* (属性) 末影/诡秘法术强度，攻击伤害</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>希望你玩得开心！&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>部分特殊动画由我制作 (严禁传播，我敢打赌你... 别这么做)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">滅絕雙拳套：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">滅絕 <span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">對決&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_26d10e95-254b-431d-ba4c-05b2d873d52b.png\" width=\"340\" height=\"321\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_7d14ef6f-2a8a-43be-be0d-7225f3f7b1e7.png\" width=\"301\" height=\"320\"></p>\n<p><strong>技能 4 (按 H)</strong></p>\n<p>-拔出另一隻拳套，向敵人噴射<strong>烈焰</strong>並召喚<strong>流星墜落</strong>（持續時間：10秒）<strong>（冷卻時間：30秒）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>奧利維恩荊棘：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>自然治癒</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>技能_1_2 (同時按住鼠標左鍵和右鍵)</strong></span></p>\n<p>-簡單地給予你再生 II (8秒) &amp; 橡木皮膚 III (15秒) （冷卻時間：15秒）</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>叢生根須</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_481a17c1-d2a7-4dad-a872-addb6406a9d6.png\" width=\"362\" height=\"274\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_5c37861e-1303-4f14-baa3-a50214a0d124.png\" width=\"308\" height=\"273\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">技能 3 (按 X)</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>放置陷阱</strong>，在<strong>3秒</strong>後生長出一根觸手，<strong>捕捉範圍內的所有生物（除了施法者本人）</strong>並將它們<strong>困住 10秒（冷卻時間：20秒）</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>地震</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_254949a6-6e04-41c1-9e72-0242a1da5551.png\" width=\"468\" height=\"315\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">技能 4 (按 H)</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 跳起並猛擊地面，在<strong>半徑 10格</strong>內引發<strong>地震</strong>，使敵人<strong>倒地</strong>並造成<strong>巨大傷害（冷卻時間：45秒）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>虛空打擊收割者：</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">終界狂怒</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">技能_1_2 (同時按住鼠標左鍵和右鍵)</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 你的狂怒使附近敵人陷入眩暈狀態，並且你在<strong>10秒</strong>內對敵人造成的傷害<strong>增加 30%</strong></span>（冷卻時間：25秒）</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">漩風暴：</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_1d57f1a8-5fa1-4015-9d11-2a3cc719e6d1.png\" width=\"344\" height=\"314\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_35c1eaac-dc3c-44f3-bdac-807053535ad2.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"312\"></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">技能 3 (按 X)</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">召喚<strong>漩風暴</strong>，該技能將在<strong>3秒</strong>後激活，造成傷害並將<strong>敵人推入空中</strong>，使其受到<strong>跌落傷害</strong>（冷卻時間：20秒）（注意：此技能有時會將你推向空中，要修復這個問題，只需後退並激活技能即可）並且<strong>謹慎使用...</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>守護者支配：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img style=\"color:#999\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_9f400312-d364-4c00-8654-b0a853f367b6.png\" width=\"252\" height=\"215\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_33812553-d3b1-4436-b418-5e490e275d6f.png\" width=\"245\" height=\"216\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_a8f66c10-98ef-47e5-b4da-a7d0db51003f.png\" width=\"495\" height=\"307\"></span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">技能 4 + 技能 1 (按 H + 鼠標左鍵)</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">- 傳送至天空並進行重擊落地，造成高傷害並在周圍創造虛空符文，效果類似<strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">終界守護者使用傳送術衝向你</span></strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">（冷卻時間：40秒）</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>今天加入我們的 Discord 伺服器！</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pnPC3zqfW2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1242905/description_88990236-7147-4c5a-892b-922548eef929.png\" width=\"172\" height=\"172\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
